{"text":"<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ljnEq7tdUSg</p><p><br /></p><p> ##### 10. Dasakapuggalapaññatti </p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2675.001664\">44:35</span> 209. Katamesaṃ pañcannaṃ idha niṭṭhā? Sattakkhattuparamassa kolaṅkolassa ekabījissa sakadāgāmissa yo ca diṭṭheva dhamme arahā – imesaṃ pañcannaṃ idha niṭṭhā. ^4-10-209 </p><p>  </p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2695.406773\">44:55</span> Katamesaṃ pañcannaṃ idha vihāya niṭṭhā? Antarāparinibbāyissa upahaccaparinibbāyissa asaṅkhāraparinibbāyissa sasaṅkhāraparinibbāyissa uddhaṃsotassa akaniṭṭhagāmino – imesaṃ pañcannaṃ idha vihāya niṭṭhāti.</p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2723.37529\">45:23</span> Ettāvatā puggalānaṃ puggalapaññattīti.Dasakaniddeso.\n\nPuggalapaññattipakaraṇaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</p>\n","media-time":2675.404246}